b_tag\" ><strong>REUNITING THE GANG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960490/extras/9767134096d42acdfbf69ae13a8c09b1.poster.avif?t=1772723063\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960490/extras/9767134096d42acdfbf69ae13a8c09b1.webm?t=1772723063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960490/extras/9767134096d42acdfbf69ae13a8c09b1.mp4?t=1772723063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an epic all-star reunion! The Royal Revolt universe brings together a diverse and charismatic roster of heroes. Rally the squad and take on the ultimate challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISE TO THE TOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960490/extras/6115e2633773aaaa3a333c701708c79c.poster.avif?t=1772723063\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960490/extras/6115e2633773aaaa3a333c701708c79c.webm?t=1772723063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960490/extras/6115e2633773aaaa3a333c701708c79c.mp4?t=1772723063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful upgrades, stack your abilities, and grow stronger with every run. Experiment with countless mighty Weapon and Trinket combinations as you carve your own path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the ultimate battle in <i>Royal Revolt Survivors</i>. Step up, unleash your inner Warrior, and crush the invading darkness!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Real-Time Combat</strong>: Engage in thrilling Survivor-style battles with hundreds of ferocious enemies, making use of countless Weapon and Trinket combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Multiplayer Mayhem</strong>: Experience the game with up to 4 friends in its white-knuckle co-op mode, working together to overcome even the toughest of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemies and Bosses:</strong> Face off against hordes of enemies with different movement patterns and attacks, culminating in epic boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>All-Star Warrior Roster</strong>: Choose from numerous fan-favorite characters from the beloved <i>Royal Revolt </i>franchise, each with distinct abilities and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Quality Graphics</strong>: Enjoy stunning visuals, charming characters and a rich, immersive environment, presented in beautifully crafted arenas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time has come to defend your kingdom! Will you rise as a Warrior and reclaim your homeland, or will the invading darkness prevail?</p>","developers":["Team Warriors"],"dlc":[3326030],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960490/0bd26e48d1c4b898979578a80fb466751d0812ad/header.jpg?t=1772723063","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Team